{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"t":"Test 3","x":0.89251204286364727,"y":0.038607528664792556,"c":1,"w":0.066522305806477888,"h":0.015808197868199314},{"w":0.66200663248697911,"x":0.12776110483067935,"y":0.081660253102956326,"t":"shopping with visits to the town's restaurants and cafés. Most shops are small","h":0.018870556977519048,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.098968009043749805,"w":0.68063491821289068,"h":0.019760676152693502,"x":0.12774714626859443,"t":"independent stores, which is good, but many people prefer to use supermarkets"},{"x":0.86076281369573848,"t":"Q13","y":0.098290013421854061,"w":0.041555029551188172,"h":0.015954173878229061,"c":1},{"x":0.12989691550278906,"h":0.013212832295747545,"c":1,"t":"and department stores in nearby large towns, as there are so few wel-known chain","w":0.70515462239583337,"y":0.11773255807235572},{"t":"stores here.","h":0.012766316716837589,"x":0.12975432896777392,"y":0.13490002883042451,"w":0.10345620473225911,"c":1},{"x":0.1298969160277875,"w":0.67422678629557287,"c":1,"t":"Turning now to medical facilities, the town is served by family doctors in several","h":0.01453488361674482,"y":0.14970930237544477},{"t":"medical practices - fewer than 50 years ago, but each catering for far more patients.","y":0.16559013494906627,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"x":0.12989690005074672,"w":0.71752578735351569},{"h":0.014534883616744709,"w":0.64123713175455721,"y":0.18168604656088183,"t":"Qur hospital closed 15 years ago, which means journeys to other towns are","c":1,"x":0.12989689791581091},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"w":0.67216496785481772,"t":"unavoidable. On the other hand, there are more dentists than there used to be.","x":0.12989689741318056,"y":0.1975924838623474},{"x":0.12989691943579185,"y":0.21366279086483253,"w":0.77319585164388016,"t":"Employment patters have changed, along with almost everything else. Ihe number. Q15","h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.12989690735434417,"t":"of schools and colleges has increased, making that the main employ ment sector.","w":0.68453608194986981,"y":0.22959483277577764,"h":0.014679976512037674},{"t":"Services, such as website design and accountancy, have grown in importance, and","w":0.70515462239583326,"x":0.12989691550281199,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"y":0.24563953505067793},{"x":0.12989689872637628,"w":0.69484537760416676,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"y":0.26159718124655806,"t":"surprisingly, perhaps, manufacturing hasn't seen the decline that has affected it in"},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"y":0.27761627908725328,"w":0.21855669657389323,"t":"other parts of the country.","x":0.12783505360799693,"c":1},{"w":0.67628865559895834,"t":"Now I'Il very quickly outline current plans for some of the town's facilities, before","h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"y":0.31826189076542177,"x":0.12989690920691524},{"x":0.12989690161218495,"c":1,"w":0.22474227905273439,"t":"asking for your comments.","h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.334302325509092},{"c":1,"x":0.12989690870566184,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"As you'll know if you regularly use the car park at the railway station, it's usually full.","y":0.34879624179286361,"w":0.70721649169921874},{"w":0.71958760579427083,"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1,"x":0.12989691891888366,"t":"The railway company applied for permission to replace it with a multi-storey car park,","y":0.36482558154415212},{"c":1,"h":0.019546606228481811,"t":"but that was refused. Instead, the company has bought some adioining land, and this Q16","x":0.12977657240961898,"y":0.37930046080950763,"w":0.77344172159830715},{"x":0.12783505039146092,"y":0.39812096288374499,"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.46185567220052082,"c":1,"t":"will be used to increase the number of parking spaces"},{"y":0.41424418621175496,"h":0.015988371754420694,"x":0.12989691740796444,"t":"The Grand, the old cinema in the high street. will close at the end of the year, and","w":0.6969071960449218,"c":1},{"w":0.67835052490234382,"t":"reopen on a different site, You've probably seen the building under construction.","x":0.12783504674253823,"y":0.43012331179987329,"c":1,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"h":0.015988371754420472,"c":1,"x":0.12783505169952983,"t":"The plan is to have three screens with fewer seats, rather than just the one large","y":0.44622093039929722,"w":0.68453608194986981},{"h":0.015349285643169397,"t":"auditorium in the old cinema.","x":0.12971583283985752,"w":0.24584541320800782,"c":1,"y":0.46006887211077663},{"w":0.7216494750976562,"y":0.47819767446855987,"x":0.12577320048937679,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"t":"Iexpect many of you shop in the indoor market. It's become more and more shabby-"},{"h":0.019036313749661637,"c":1,"t":"looking, and because of fears about safety, it was threatened with demolition. The","y":0.49167938126913735,"w":0.69907231648763024,"x":0.12571176274615206},{"w":0.039175256093343047,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.49418604640563268,"c":1,"t":"Q18","x":0.86185567082575121},{"y":0.50821326099620856,"h":0.016720018034042883,"x":0.12570828338273762,"w":0.69908340454101559,"c":1,"t":"good news is that it will close for six weeks to be made safe and redecorated, and"},{"x":0.12567703702991964,"t":"the improved building will open in July.","y":0.52475794196473058,"w":0.32805374145507815,"c":1,"h":0.016007494520455023},{"c":1,"t":"Lots of people use the library, including school and college students who go there to","w":0.71340204874674473,"x":0.12577320232027175,"h":0.014534883616744709,"y":0.54215116284052645},{"t":"study. Ihe council has managed to secure funding to keep the library open later into.","y":0.55628040357913178,"x":0.127776698719058,"h":0.017945563450184387,"c":1,"w":0.71761581420898435},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.72577321370442716,"c":1,"x":0.12783504257104653,"t":"the evening, twice a week. We would like to enlarge the building in the not-too-distant","y":0.57398708186519121},{"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1,"t":"future, but this is by no means definite.","w":0.3298969014485677,"x":0.12783505431337061,"y":0.59011627923339915},{"c":1,"h":0.019680934867926103,"w":0.68889099121093744,"t":"There's no limit on access to the nature reserve on the edge of town, and this will","y":0.60294214583243533,"x":0.12771150567911491},{"t":"continue to be the case. What will change, though, is that the council will no longer","w":0.70103093465169275,"y":0.62063953504207126,"x":0.12783504824822511,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1},{"h":0.014679976512037674,"y":0.63799177913284477,"w":0.70515462239583326,"t":"be in charge of the area. Instead it will become the responsibility of a national body","c":1,"x":0.12577320416136936},{"c":1,"y":0.63808139524524665,"w":0.039175256093343047,"t":"Q20","x":0.85979381514920461,"h":0.013081395479068947},{"t":"that administers most nature reserves in the country.","h":0.01453488361674482,"y":0.65406976747997736,"c":1,"x":0.12783506119298607,"w":0.44329895019531251},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"w":0.22680412292480467,"x":0.12783505180048421,"y":0.66999412803938052,"t":"OK, now let me ask you ..."},{"t":"SECTION 3","x":0.057731960560587985,"c":1,"h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.72225484446094979,"w":0.16288659413655598},{"w":0.31371287027994793,"h":0.01846427379883675,"y":0.74856415382912966,"x":0.055476374616768569,"c":1,"t":"JEREMY: Hello, Helen. Sorry I'm late."},{"c":1,"y":0.76889534896064404,"t":"HELEN:","h":0.0087209299460482281,"w":0.053608245849609382,"x":0.057731959436957275},{"y":0.76452850847432574,"w":0.68260630289713542,"h":0.016622119417487369,"c":1,"t":"Hi, Jeremy, no problem. Well we'd better work out where we are on our project, I","x":0.13190826992074894},{"w":0.77938145955403637,"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"JEREMY: Yeah. I've looked at the drawings you've done for my story, 'The Forest', and I think","x":0.057731950528705243,"y":0.79796511632865641},{"w":0.7073338317871094,"h":0.017132569255369656,"x":0.13190246672200592,"y":0.81283136704132242,"t":"they're brilliant - they really create the atmosphere I had in mind when I was writing","c":1},{"h":0.011627906221399864,"w":0.016494844754536941,"x":0.13195876306603049,"y":0.83139534909860235,"c":1,"t":"it."},{"x":0.055670103772102519,"t":"HELEN:","w":0.053608245849609382,"y":0.84883720954244035,"h":0.010174418083723991,"c":1},{"t":"JEREMY:","w":0.061855672200520843,"h":0.010174418083724102,"c":1,"x":0.057731957615203493,"y":0.86482558163546341},{"h":0.011627907341393073,"c":1,"x":0.055670102645581421,"t":"HELEN:","y":0.88081395328076961,"w":0.051546392440795896},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"I'm glad you like them.","y":0.84586024645500946,"c":1,"w":0.19381443023681641,"x":0.12989690843567178},{"w":0.41875951131184896,"x":0.12980790979993118,"c":1,"h":0.01588564764662348,"t":"There are just a few suggestions I'd like to make.","y":0.86060504825376283},{"t":"Go ahead.","y":0.87826804239048606,"x":0.13170198043160269,"h":0.01373826260435107,"w":0.093299776713053395,"c":1},{"y":0.893555071223324,"w":0.84136622111002612,"c":1,"x":0.055615774019497147,"t":"JEREMY: Now, I'm not sure about the drawing of the cave - it's got trees all around it, which is Q21","h":0.018073755646199952},{"y":0.91133294173417523,"w":0.63917526245117184,"c":1,"x":0.12989690475565643,"h":0.015992639488986327,"t":"great, but the drawing's a bit too static, isn't it? I think it needs some action."},{"y":0.9543054561580997,"w":0.29146792093912754,"h":0.022615832576874939,"c":1,"x":0.3521918184962084,"t":"leltsresources.org"},{"w":0.039175256093343047,"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.90927835129181633,"y":0.94331395347990266,"c":1,"t":"115"}]}